# Advisories npm audit reports against this closure that its gate never
# reaches, one per line: the GHSA id, the package npm reports it against,
# then why (README, "Gating devkit itself"). An entry no advisory matches
# fails make audit, so a bump that fixes one forces its removal.
# markdownlint-cli 0.49.1, the newest release when these were added
# (2026-10-11), pins all three below their fixed versions, so no lockfile
# bump cleared them. lint.mjs loads markdownlint's library, jsonc-parser and
# ignore, never the CLI. devkit runs the CLI only as `markdownlint --version`
# at install (lib/node_closure.sh), which exits before it reads any
# configuration, and in tests/markdown_isolation_test.sh with a JSONC config.
GHSA-r3ph-w7gj-g6xm js-yaml only markdownlint-cli's YAML config reader requires it, lazily, and lint.mjs never runs the CLI
GHSA-r4xh-jqrq-34v2 smol-toml only markdownlint-cli's TOML config reader requires it, lazily, and lint.mjs never runs the CLI
